@i-identity:I{ky=~18:identity_reference;pr=@project;so=[@s-assignment,@s-reference];st=confirmed;vl=~13:reference.png;wh=@user;wy=~151:The user names reference.png as the agreed identity, so it is the authority for the family's silhouette and face features, not merely an earlier asset.}
@i-identity-features:I{ky=~17:identity_features;pr=@project;so=[@s-reference];st=observed;vl=[~17:two head antennae,~8:two eyes,~42:bilateral symmetry about the sprite centre];wh=@actor;wy=~176:Measured from reference.png: outline antennae at x7-10 and x21-24 over y3-8, and accent eyes at x11-13 and x18-20 over y14-17. Recorded as observed, not user-confirmed wording.}
@i-palette:I{ky=~2:pl;pr=@project;so=[@s-assignment,@s-reference];st=confirmed;vl=[~7:#25354A,~7:#56B5BC,~7:#F4DDA2];wh=@user;wy=~146:The user states the reference palette is already correct. These are the three visible colours measured in reference.png: outline, body and accent.}
